**Every-tenant-table migration pattern:**
```sql
alter table <schema>.X enable row level security; alter table <schema>.X force row level security;
create policy tenant_isolation on <schema>.X
  using (tenant_id = current_setting('app.tenant_id')::uuid)
  with check (tenant_id = current_setting('app.tenant_id')::uuid);
grant select, insert on <schema>.X to <login>;      -- append-only; add column-level UPDATE only where needed; never DELETE
```

**Daily job pattern:**
- `create function <schema>.<x>_tenants() returns setof uuid language sql stable security definer set search_path = pg_catalog, pg_temp as $$ select distinct tenant_id from … $$;`
- grant execute to the login.
- The route `POST /api/cron/daily` checks `x-cron-secret` against `CRON_SECRET` with `timingSafeEqual`; it
  returns 503 if unset.

**Reminder stage rule** (Document Store, `src/lib/expiry.ts`):
```ts
d>30→null; d>7→"d30"; d>1→"d7"; d===1→"d1"; d>-7→"d0"; else `expired_w${floor(-d/7)}`
```
